WEBVTT

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:02.110
We are now one of the largest
running events in the Middle East,

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.110
but most importantly,

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:08.230
it is a platform for hope and cooperation

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:13.160
in an ever-fragile
and unstable part of the world.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:19.150
From Boston to Beirut, we stand as one.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:25.230
(Applause)

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.220
After 10 years in Lebanon,

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.140
from national marathons
or from national events